'''Pastry Cat''' (ネコパティシエ Neko Patishie, '''Cat Pâtissier''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pastry Cat
|image = E 137.png
|first appearance = [[Way of the Samurai (Veteran)]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 23|Infernal Tower - Floor 23]]
|money drop = 1,900¢ - 7,505¢
}}

==Enemy==
This is the enemy version of the True Form of Samurai Cat. He has high health and high DPS, and he can [[Slow|slow]] Cats. He is not too much of a worry, as his range is pretty low and he can easily be stalled by constant streams of meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], but he is not to be taken lightly and is very deadly as support.

